QuantumBridge SDK

QuantumBridge is an independent project maintained by QuantumBridge contributors.

The project includes optional compatibility layers that can interoperate with
installed Qiskit and PennyLane packages for a limited subset of workflows.
Qiskit and PennyLane are separate projects owned by their respective
rightsholders. QuantumBridge is not an official IBM, Qiskit, Xanadu, or
PennyLane project, and this notice does not imply endorsement by those parties.

